; The import ledger: beangulp loads this one. It includes the journal — so the
; hook sees the tagged transactions that resolve occurrences — but excludes
; Schedules.bean and the plugin, so injected forecast entries never appear to the
; hook as existing ones. Point the hook at Schedules.bean directly with
; BEANSCHEDULE_SCHEDULES, or with BEANSCHEDULE_DIR holding it.
option "operating_currency" "USD"

include "journal.bean"
